  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency and recovery assistance for host communities, returnees and displaced in Maban Upper Nile</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes towards enabling affected populations in Maban to live in a dignified manner through improving hygiene awareness and practises as well as supporting the development of alternative means of livelihoods which will result in an improved quality of life of the affected people.</narrative>
  </description>
